          "_label": "Details (Official List Description)"
        }
      ],
      "content": "SP 91 SW                 MARSWORTH          BULBOURNE 6/90                                        Store 120m to N.W. of canal                                             bridge. - GV                                          II Store for canal works.  Circa 1848.  Brown brick with eaves band course, plinth and minimal corner pilasters.  Slate roof.  2 storeys, 9 bays. Ground floor of front to canal has alternate wide and narrow windows with segmental white brick heads.  Wide windows have cast iron glazing bars with decorative roundels at intersections.  Narrow windows are irregular, those to centre with small panes, that to right with marginal glazing, that to left blind.  First floor has window with segmental head to left, central door, and 3 skylights. Listing NGR: SP9324413745"
    }
  ],
